      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BODHI BUZZ (2) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his handy 21.88 win at this track over 380m. Rates a top chance if runs up to time two back. TAU CETI (3) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts four wins and seven placings. Comes off a (22.02) win last time, scoring by a nose in a Grade 5 over 380m at this track. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. VERRUCKT (1) settled down midfield and held his position to the line when finishing 4th (22.26) at this track. Has ability and can atone. BLUE JET TRAIN (7) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
